## The first face you see.

Arriving somewhere new is the tiring part of any trip. The flight, the passport queue, the luggage belt, and then the doors open onto a crowd of drivers all calling at once. With a private pickup at Hurghada or Marsa Alam, that moment becomes the easiest of the day: you walk out, and the person who will look after your days is already there, waiting for you.

## From the arrivals hall to your hotel door

Your flight is followed, so someone is there whether you land early or late. Your concierge helps with your bags, walks you to a private, air-conditioned car with cold water waiting, and on the drive talks through your days with you: when you'll be collected, what to wear for the temples, what to bring. By the time you reach your hotel, anywhere from El Gouna to Marsa Alam, there's nothing left to wonder about.

> The trip doesn't start when you reach the first temple. It starts when someone is waiting for you.

## Included in your day

Land at Hurghada or Marsa Alam up to 24 hours before your private day, and the pickup is part of it, on the Original and the Signature day alike. Design your day, send us your flight, and the rest is ours to handle: local knowledge and our craft, so all you do is walk out of arrivals.
